WEBVTT

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:50.580
THE CLASH OF POWERFUL SWORDS

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.420
<i>My sword realizes it!</i>

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.430
Hey! Don't use your crest at full power!

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:02.510
You need to conserve your energy!

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:05.310
No! He's not the Hadlar we knew!

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:09.140
I have to fight
with my full strength or we'll die!

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:14.780
An astute observation!
You truly are my rival!

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:43.220
I expect nothing less
from a Disciple of Avan!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:52.650
Oh?

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:11.080
H-Hadlar's completely changed!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.000
He's a complete monster now!

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.550
I've seen those features somewhere...

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:41.610
C-Could he be a Superior Being?!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.450
W-What?!

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:48.790
<i>He was converted
using the data Zamza sent!</i>

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.620
Isn't that right, Hadlar?!

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:54.920
You'll see when you fight me.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.590
You can experience it yourself.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:04.550
This power I obtained
by sacrificing everything!

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.730
And realize...

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:16.980
compared to all the powerful enemies
that you've fought...

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.190
just how powerful I am!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.750
D-Dai!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.640
<i>Th-That's impossible!</i>

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:53.680
<i>I blocked him with
the crest power focused in my right hand!</i>

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.230
<i>It's numb!</i>

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.730
<i>I can't draw my sword like this!</i>

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:09.990
Boom!

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.800
A-A spell?! How?!

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:27.680
I thought Superior Beings
couldn't cast spells!

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:38.690
Stop, Hadlar!

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:40.730
No, you stop.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:47.320
Hold it. We're at a ceasefire for now.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.070
Out of respect for Commander Hadlar.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:55.790
After all, this is a one-on-one duel
between him and Dai.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:06:01.460
Get real! We never agreed
to any one-on-one business!

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:06.340
I believe you have an obligation
to see this duel through.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.050
Hadlar can no longer become a Darkling.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:14.140
He gave up everything for this battle.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:16.980
Gave up?!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.810
I know!

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.400
In order to be able to cast spells,

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:27.110
he gave up the ability to turn from
a Superior Being back to a Darkling!

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:31.910
So Hadlar is stuck
in that monster form forever!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.160
That's right.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:40.170
I hate to admit it, but as a result
he has gotten just a little stronger.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.000
Yup, yup!

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:46.550
<i>"Just a little"?! Are you kidding me?!</i>

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.130
<i>A Superior Being that can cast spells?!</i>

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:53.970
<i>That's a formula for true flawlessness!</i>

00:06:56.720 --> 00:07:00.560
I no longer care for my Darkling body!

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.730
In fact, by giving it up,

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:10.650
I was able to discard my foolish pride as
the Dark Lord who dominated the world!

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:17.660
True victory can never be attained
by one obsessed with reputation!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:24.130
This is a lesson
your master Avan taught me!

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:32.590
<i>He's strong!</i>

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:36.850
<i>Not only that,
he's more resolute than ever before!</i>

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:39.720
<i>I can't beat him without my sword!</i>

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:42.560
<i>I need to draw it
with my left hand somehow!</i>

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:08.960
Boom!

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.880
Wave Slash!

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.150
Ah...

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.700
So that's your new sword.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:44.540
Very well.
We shall see with your next strike,

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:48.290
whether the power within my right arm

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:52.130
is stronger than the power of your sword!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.550
The power within his right arm?

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:58.720
Does he have a power
greater than those claws?!

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.510
N-No way!

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:06.520
I've seen the awesome destructive power
of the Sword of Dai!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:10.440
No matter what sort of
killer attack he has,

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:13.240
it can't be stronger than that!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.410
Dai, hurry up and finish it!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.670
Don't forget that Superior Beings
regenerate while fighting!

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.960
<i>I know that, Popp.</i>

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.750
<i>I intend to finish it!</i>

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.930
<i>Good. The feeling's returned!</i>

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:41.560
Hm?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.430
Draconic Aura!

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:50.310
That's...

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.520
Is that...?

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:00.240
Avan Strash.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:05.540
The attack that cleaved Sovereign
Rock Castle was probably Earth Slash.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:08.920
And he just used Wave Slash.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:14.800
This will be the first Avan Strash
the Sword of Dai unleashes.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:18.470
No matter what
amazing power you have hidden,

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:23.600
it can't beat this strike
I've filled with all my power!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.930
Then try it.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:30.270
If you're right, I'll be cleaved in two.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:34.110
But I will be testing myself, too!

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:40.410
The ultimate being
said to be of divine creation...

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:44.120
A strike from such a Dragon Knight...

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:50.790
will reveal just how complete a weapon
I, Hadlar the Superior Being, have become!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:59.170
He seems pretty confident.
I wonder what power he's gained.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:03.390
<i>I won't lose!
Not while I have the Sword of Dai!</i>

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:07.180
<i>No matter who I face!</i>

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.230
<i>I won't lose!</i>

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:14.610
Here goes, Hadlar!

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:15.320
Come on!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.440
Avan...

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.780
Strash!

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.580
Did it work?!

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.180
That's impossible!

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:52.730
A direct hit from the Sword of Dai,
and his arm isn't even cut!

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:57.320
Is his... Is Hadlar's body
harder than Orichalcum?!

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.400
Th-That's not it!

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:07.450
I felt the impact of something metallic!

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:13.290
That's right, Dai. I have one, too.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:17.790
A legendary weapon equal to your own.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:21.050
The Sword of Champions.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:24.260
The Sword of Champions?

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.470
That's right! Zamza gave it to Hadlar!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:32.350
Indeed. The real Sword of Champions...

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.640
is right here.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.700
In my right arm!

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.580
AVAN STRASH

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:59.590
REAPER FLUTE

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:09.800
Yow!

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.520
Could this Dark Aura be...?

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.890
Dark Fire Energy.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.730
What?!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.520
Dark Fire Energy! Dark! Fire! Energy!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:25.280
A Dark Aura that burns life energy
beyond its limits!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.650
Remember that!

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:36.210
I can tell from that strike!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:40.130
My power is on par with
that of a Dragon Knight!

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:46.720
And with an equal weapon,
my fighting power is greater!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.180
Dai!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.390
But I won't hold back!

00:13:56.560 --> 00:14:03.150
To not fight with my fullest abilities
would be disrespectful!

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.820
Take this, Dai!

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:11.200
A strike I unleash
using the Sword of Champions!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.460
Ultra Combustion Slash!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.130
Ultra Combustion Slash?!

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:26.760
Not a bad idea.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:30.260
By using Dark Fire Energy
along his sword,

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:33.760
the power of his attack is magnified.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.220
Oh wow!

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:37.480
Dai! Run!

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:38.890
Don't get hit!

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:43.820
<i>I-I can't! It's too late!</i>

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:47.440
<i>I have to defend with my Draconic Aura!</i>

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.910
<i>My Aura's weak!</i>

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.540
Die!

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.960
Oh my. Did he finish him?

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.510
Oh! Look there!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.140
A Zoom spell.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:18.180
Popp jumped in and rescued Dai.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:24.230
It's supposed to be one-on-one!
You cheater!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.610
Hey! They're running! Get back here!

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:33.620
They won't get away!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.090
Oh wow! He's super fast!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:51.970
Let's follow them.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:02.560
I never thought
I'd be called a cheater by them!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:06.440
P-Popp... Why...?

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.230
Dai, I'll be honest with you.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:13.280
You can't beat Hadlar alone!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:19.910
Until now, he always tended
to give in to his emotions.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:25.120
<i>That's why even I was able
to match him somehow.</i>

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:29.500
But Hadlar's changed!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:33.510
He isn't just stronger
from becoming a Superior Being!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:36.180
It's like his mind has been cleared!

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:39.720
Guys like that
who don't waver are dangerous.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.020
I'd know. I've been there.

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:44.480
B-But...!

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:47.980
Enough! We're going back to Papnica!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:52.820
We're already exhausted
from fighting Sovereign Rock Castle!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.070
Here we go!

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.030
Zoom!

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:03.330
<i>Oh crap! I've used too much Magic Power!</i>

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.370
What's wrong, Popp?

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:12.880
Don't worry! Let's just run
as far as possible with Levizoom!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.300
Where are you going, Popp?

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:23.680
You're headed East.
That's not the way back.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:18:00.010
How do you like
my flawless Superior Being?!

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:06.310
If he defeats Dai, it will mean
he's surpassed a Dragon Knight!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:10.900
He will be greater than
the god-created Dragon Knight!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.900
Meaning I've surpassed the gods!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:19.610
Surely it's safe to say now
that I am a god!

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:28.870
<i>He can already use Levizoom
without the use of his crest.</i>

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:33.630
<i>I can't take my eyes off him for a second.</i>

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:41.720
Dai! Don't!

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.600
Don't do it!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:47.850
<i>Popp, run! While I'm keeping him busy!</i>

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.310
The power of your crest has faded.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:54.900
That means your Draconic Aura is gone.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:03.200
It looks like I win!

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:06.700
<i>I have to attack!</i>

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:11.960
<i>Defending with what Draconic Aura or
Magic Power I have left won't be enough!</i>

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.250
It's over! Take this!

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:20.050
<i>Anything! Some sort of attack that uses
all my Aura and Magic Power at once!</i>

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.260
Ultra Combustion Slash!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:38.570
L-Look!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:43.110
Dai!

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:50.580
N-No!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.790
He got Dai?!

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.130
Dai!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:58.380
Dai!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:19:59.840
Dai!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.170
Dai!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:04.890
Dai!

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:10.520
Dai!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:20.440
Th-This can't be happening!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:24.530
The Sword of Dai
was supposed to be unrivaled!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.410
Come out, Dai!

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:30.790
Get back here and fight back!

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:33.830
H-He defeated the Hero!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:38.920
A clash between Orichalcum weapons
means conditions are matched.

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:43.590
In terms of physical strength,
a Superior Being is more powerful.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.640
This is probably Hadlar's victory.

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:50.220
It's no fair. He's hogging all the glory.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:00.150
Hadlar!

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:03.950
See? Hadlar wins.

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:30.680
A true Hero.
I'd be disappointed otherwise.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:40.230
H-Hadlar, too?!

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:41.980
I-It was a draw?!

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:50.490
Myst, go see to Hadlar, will you?

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:52.120
I...

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:56.960
will take care of him.

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:07.430
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:07.430
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:11.390
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:11.390
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:15.470
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:15.470
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:19.520
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:19.520
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.820
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.820
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:26.740
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:26.740
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:30.450
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:30.450
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:30.610 --> 00:22:34.740
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:30.610 --> 00:22:34.740
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:38.790
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:38.790
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:42.590
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:42.590
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:48.170
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:48.170
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:53.760
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:53.760
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:57.560
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:57.560
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:57.730 --> 00:22:59.850
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:57.730 --> 00:22:59.850
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:04.020
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:04.020
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:08.530
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:08.530
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:08.690 --> 00:23:11.700
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:08.690 --> 00:23:11.700
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:16.410
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:16.410
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:22.580
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:22.580
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:38.350
<i>Dai and Hadlar's fierce battle
has ended in a draw.</i>

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:40.680
<i>Wounded, Hadlar leaves the battlefield.</i>

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:44.480
<i>Meanwhile, Dai remains missing
after falling into the ocean.</i>

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:48.150
<i>Left alone, Popp is hounded by Killvearn.</i>

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:51.150
<i>Can Popp manage to survive?</i>

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:53.820
<i>And what happened to Dai?</i>

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:56.280
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:58.080
<i>"The Hero Lost in the Glacier"</i>

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:00.290
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
